error messages of heic2any, and the GIF output of gifshot/omggif as used by
heic2any. Those projects are MIT licensed:

- heic2any: Copyright (c) 2020 Alex Corvi (MIT License)
  https://github.com/alexcorvi/heic2any
- gifshot: Copyright (c) 2017 Yahoo Inc. (MIT License)
  https://github.com/yahoo/gifshot
